**Closures accepted only with constructor + downstream checked use + independent rebuild:** SR-4 and SR-5 (vankampen; unconditional about V2 data, conditionally consumed), B1 **dimension 1 only**, and KV-10/NCF-9 **flat-model only**. I4/U7 and the DeTurck U8 antecedent are explicitly **not** accepted. No card is treated as proving Poincaré; no `sorry`/`axiom`/`admit`/`unsafe`/`native_decide`/`proof_wanted` is used by this audit.
